                                "sense_id": "286cf7ae-1bba-3f19-a61a-2e645db6494c",
                                "text": "Gorged nearly to the uttermost when he entered the restaurant, the smell of food had almost caused him to lose his honor as a gentleman, but he rallied like a true knight."
                            },
